### N8N Custom Skills API - Test Requests
### Use with REST Client extension in VS Code or any HTTP client

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. List All Skills
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/skills

### 3. Get Nanobanana Skill Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/skills/nanobanana-prompt

### 4. Execute Nanobanana Skill (Simple)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skillName": "nanobanana-prompt",
  "userMessage": "Generate a design prompt for a Christmas coupon with vintage 90s hip-hop aesthetic.",
  "maxTokens": 4096
}

### 5. Nanobanana Convenience Endpoint - Christmas Coupon
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/nanobanana
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "intent": "Coupon Promo",
  "theme": "Christmas",
  "style": "Vintage 90s hip-hop aesthetic with burnt monochrome color scheme, bold typography, paper texture"
}

### 6. Nanobanana - Black Friday Sale
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/nanobanana
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "intent": "Social Countdown",
  "theme": "Black Friday",
  "style": "Bold modern design with electric colors and geometric shapes",
  "additionalInstructions": "Focus on urgency and excitement"
}

### 7. Nanobanana - Summer Beach Party
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/nanobanana
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "intent": "Social Countdown",
  "theme": "Summer Beach Party",
  "style": "Vibrant tropical aesthetic with gradient colors",
  "referenceImageUrl": "https://example.com/template.jpg"
}

### 8. Nanobanana - Professional CV
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/nanobanana
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "intent": "CV Letter",
  "theme": "Professional Minimalist",
  "style": "Clean modern typography with subtle accents",
  "additionalInstructions": "Keep decorations minimal and professional"
}

### 9. Execute with Conversation History
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/execute/conversation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skillName": "nanobanana-prompt",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I need a design prompt for a New Year sale."
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'd be happy to help! What intent are you targeting? (e.g., Coupon Promo, Social Countdown, etc.)"
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's for a social media countdown post with a neon aesthetic."
    }
  ],
  "maxTokens": 4096
}

### 10. Error Test - Invalid Skill
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skillName": "non-existent-skill",
  "userMessage": "Test message"
}

### 11. Error Test - Missing Required Parameters
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/nanobanana
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "intent": "Coupon Promo"
}

### 12. Full Example - Valentine's Day Promotion
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/nanobanana
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "intent": "Coupon Promo",
  "theme": "Valentine's Day",
  "style": "Romantic pastel aesthetic with soft gradients and elegant typography",
  "additionalInstructions": "Use heart motifs and romantic color palette (pink, red, cream)",
  "maxTokens": 8192
}

### 13. Full Example - Tech Product Launch
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/nanobanana
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "intent": "Social Countdown",
  "theme": "Tech Innovation",
  "style": "Futuristic design with neon accents, gradient backgrounds, and sleek typography",
  "additionalInstructions": "Emphasize cutting-edge technology and innovation",
  "model": "claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022",
  "maxTokens": 8192
}

### 14. cURL Example (copy and paste to terminal)
# curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/nanobanana \
#   -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
#   -d '{
#     "intent": "Coupon Promo",
#     "theme": "Halloween",
#     "style": "Spooky vintage aesthetic with dark colors"
#   }'
